{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1404,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:841ebc718cc9198bca1b7c52",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勇猛そうに見えるでしょう？\r\n事実、勇気りんりんですっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e45491b1b42567f33367d5c0a8ce0a4a8a38cf5bb7f81f8c97c77366ffa2108",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "70216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52fd6051342d0613f0f2cf1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晴れ舞台ですもの、普段より\r\nちょっぴりカッコよく参りましょう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fdb667bc07b150b8078277f77a147229509604c2dd26d082484c59b287e67a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "70217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:073a45349acd07433f6bdd95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "特雷森学园中满是各种有趣的事物。\r\n看来我可以度过快乐的时光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9b9013d0b3c8a02ebfe58caf20a8c31e1779dbe12fbc6397d6c47dfa6c9ab44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d99c7d74776d626a232f3783",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我这样穿……是正确的吗？\r\n穿上露肚子的衣服对我来说很新鲜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98be02baf2f924fa125b697adb862134641d128fb91960c652a2c533c605f1d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8c9d137d4dda754606d7fa2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "钻石将绽放光芒──\r\n既坚强又优美，无比闪耀的光芒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "660d975f5f751514da2fd2329ae2acd213ed4d160070a108c9e7f4cf36d3da50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0a18e13a62a113858ad9476",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然我已经穿上这套制服，\r\n接下来可就无法收手了呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "eef587b9cfbc79221d0b44db4a890d501bcbb066788df7e3aa1ac1253e44b967",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a665017fda33f894e6fe71b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "站上舞台能令人更加闪耀。\r\n所以我会全力以赴，绝不懈怠♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c44ed6a8b055a8892fa84d7e378f925e56a8d171f6222772c24a2e1d93a54507",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd06b89d77aa409b1964f7d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "柔美的荷叶边能为我增添华丽气息。\r\n但前提是我自己要先绽放光芒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "249d3672eba89845eac1aaa1a636abf7fbb0f73412bc59e0b19d19c9f1a8afbd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ed99c914841efa8dd024057",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这丰富的色彩，\r\n让人觉得能度过清新的一年呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e96387f36ebe72312980a63591cd40152add36036acba18e80b5848b830a2074",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "71016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46f9ef8b83d6394a399d2ecf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一定会抵达耀眼的巅峰……\r\n我感觉到了那样的力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c87fe746d05326249c187c508e108776b9a3b4a2e340ff7be1ba00cd2153030",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90039dc230e598ecb0f1f7ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样？适合我吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "587d4810e9777d4061316f8b6e50f8bc787c4031edf6dd846afa8760985812a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78a7b8a6b858e99b85bf77e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要放进展示柜里♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "37f1c25471f72eb882c3328f2cfc083be01edba0bcbe926d42f0401e1fde8183",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:632c2890f1cded905c09b7c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勇猛そうに見えるでしょう？\r\n事実、勇気りんりんですっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e45491b1b42567f33367d5c0a8ce0a4a8a38cf5bb7f81f8c97c77366ffa2108",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "71216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc9bfed4a4211b8317266cdd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晴れ舞台ですもの、普段より\r\nちょっぴりカッコよく参りましょう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fdb667bc07b150b8078277f77a147229509604c2dd26d082484c59b287e67a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "71217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f87eae5c215f28811da69a86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f747fdfd41fdd19d5e6205e2563472ecb3e45190ea9201c283e895272ee13e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:720a0880423b796fe3727aea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ダイヤはとても硬い宝石です。\r\nそれを打ち砕くというのですね？\r\nふふ、わかりました！",
      "source_fingerprint": "61fcc19807cd4c57ad6980fbedcc7544d75efda3e55b7c7ae4a92050e2c03445",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1fb8121ead64ba595c397aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "まあ、すごいお力…！\r\nでしたら私ももっと\r\n輝いてみせましょう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "24be0cfc17de36145aaf793d0a3beadb6a9691f13b0a69620219195aa71075e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2604d76a81766ece3f69a6cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安！\r\n请问今天要从事\r\n什么挑战呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a052a75a2c312ffff70b840cdfed68e339fa7f8844a409b5dfa6dc487b67673",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9663ba82c0a760be671037d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我早上都会跟小北一起做发声练习。\r\n所以我对自已明亮且充满精神的\r\n招呼声很有自信喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "cec184290f61f7bb50cb23dc8d6d1e62ddb47af33162e2bd7c15aca26a2378b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1174ac4ba511986d848bd110",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟朋友一起品尝好茶，\r\n一起努力训练……\r\n呵呵，今天真是美好的一天呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d444e399f5779fe8bdc3082d01942ee90eabbb8df0d5987b13c935e0bf5d0097",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:407288fe87ee1f2e5df84627",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我可以去学园外面跑一下吗？\r\n我想跟附近邻居们\r\n更加增进感情♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "16417c204440e4251d29ed6905a395d47d84931d85852c7e102f25fa300610ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c33ddb4a127ebad1f436f62e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "都这么晚了你还在埋头工作啊。\r\n我也该向你看齐，学习你那\r\n总是认真努力的态度！",
      "source_fingerprint": "09b5945d97db08ac58806dc36d986ee3e84e20278a4e3e74508ee204c0fdd8c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9101bc277fdc2d99c6b8fa0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "回去后跟小北一起写作业吧♪\r\n我觉得两个人一起写\r\n能更快写完呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "965a3e11e23f5d494388dc4034beedc366ba90ee1b9de7a9468c86c0618d2c53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85c4f773ad60a05a5459d8ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天天气真好，很适合打高尔夫呢。\r\n让我回想起以前曾经为了赢过父亲，\r\n在球场坚持好几轮的回忆呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "51068b38285e7dbba96ba9c2e7a76fd88736dd33d207859341f91b4e2224ed0a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:285e2a7123992b96bf274f52",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以前我常在夏季前往避暑胜地别墅，\r\n在大自然中奔跑。或许当时的经验\r\n也成了我的养分喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb5c8f05f057974d0a6aa69af603f3013f3de4657ed19aaf9c94dbc021bc2485",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ced1d0ed2116a8abd1f57f12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个时期，我家庭院里会开出壮观的\r\n菊花……那凛然伫立的姿态\r\n总令我看得入迷。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c40bb5e751773ddf3896e1c8dee34f9b89b89b0c3c6e7f79c1cc456d02d4521",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b92944b514ff516e95e09d2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我第一次跟小北一起看比赛是在\r\n年底的时候。那天的场景……\r\n我到现在还记得一清二楚。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fcb96aa585bb0a93fb578b17cb25f01749613df70678ee5cbb2e0540a643462",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb4812e74c1f07f041499843",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新的一天又开始了。\r\n开头比什么都重要。\r\n绷紧神经出发吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "16107893e81a39a01d50879a1ffefbcab779dd15239f8edfe961f7a34dde84d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cccdbe9533a719a0cf8a516f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使不是元旦，早起看朝阳\r\n还是能够洗涤心灵呢！\r\n希望今天也能度过美好的一天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "adfbe4d5cb8a4093f36dc629868b23a8d56d4e0a084ae707edc5320faab5fc0f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82b7329441e709c41e085c27",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不晓得是不是因为吃了年糕，\r\n肚子现在还是很饱。\r\n年糕真的可以让人饱很久呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "76cb9691ed6627e0f3ba74595e60fece0e2a31b074b2de9582085d7ab424932e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c24ee9e2b15e2129aa3b542",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要穿着这件衣服，\r\n就会莫名地想吃日式料理呢。\r\n这是神明的旨意吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d2d459388715196f93da6a7975a8cb71aee47839308076584c560e73e94555e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26d04c45d1da3ef2daaed63c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走夜路的时候请小心。\r\n啊，不介意的话……\r\n我借你夜视镜吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc1986e6852a585a6e78a0969d9f58c8a221c9c46f9ff99038738725ccbd4200",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7728d5fd226eaa5ec634d55e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果你觉得累了，要不要来杯\r\n热甜酒？甜酒很有营养喔。\r\n呵呵，我晚点去帮你倒一杯♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ecf28d7bf1bfe2a634f67567da5983fa54cbd0e54553c7b733e56d79a04d3e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba1764bf48cfa7ee6b18e1ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿巫女服迎接新生们……\r\n春天充满了新的邂逅，\r\n让人按捺不住好奇心呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "57286f2109ee9a3c672412fba9d1110dc05c2cc78c6c14e789de06e31bc00bda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc7d9e534c6ac6444a4028da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件衣服夏天穿也很凉。\r\n啊，但脖子周围要小心晒伤。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ca2d8790719722f4959042fe746b4c02cc7205abaafca5d641c450221da86ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4adb7c2f37bb27433eb0b90a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "到了树叶开始变色的季节。\r\n那间神社里结的柿子，\r\n差不多可以吃了吧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bec75d186673b6ebc7bc7c39fd35eb0f8f78545b003ce345ed8ebff7c27c5b19",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef7f9dfd9ba9bfe289a56dee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和穿巫女服的小北打雪仗，\r\n一定会陷入苦战。因为她穿得\r\n一身白，根本找不到她！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ca5741ecf3d0bd48f23573b489ce5474101310069331b5d9c1ee11cfe38a54c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6122d8248af1703d58cf161",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cab8e8f5d97c5cebc217684",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f00ba4bf6b065f32a697c4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今朝食べたクロワッサン、バターが\r\n香り高くて素晴らしいお味でした！\r\nあとは焦がしさえしなければ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b22d9e96a30700394f86b6b650fd21ccf8d3694db0089bc40273140d8862fd72",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed9e1d3561b09d8d7d2156bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "旅行先では時差ボケに注意、です！\r\n前にフランスに行った時、私ったら\r\nお寝坊をしてしまったので…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b9744bde933adc94f50bd16cd04e839712d9df7dfa16a3326f04d4797f58ac0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de0e56746f759cc02b6371a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日のお茶菓子は…マドレーヌ！\r\n旅のお守りがモデルらしいですし、\r\n遠征の際にはもってこい、ですよ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e891590ec2e1cafd4812418b918b19a93867b2999efcc7b20c0c6fb34cb45f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90212"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8725f50ff51b5f1323f9980e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "リフレッシュして午後も励むため、\r\n昼下がりのお散歩はいかがですか？\r\n私、エスコートいたしますよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aadfca19b04504ac8e0e81b6d06a80327f6a1d7f4c256f971226dd106704ec54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90213"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fbd9f5bef9bdb71c6e7ef22",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昔見たシャンゼリゼ通りの夜は、\r\nライトアップがとても綺麗で…\r\n近いうちに、一緒に見ましょうね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "658ccb79f740937f5331ff02e15cb0fd7b8e119c5b74e22420c9c5329357d32d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90214"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c99244921eeb21ad13ef0b67",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Bonsoir ! 大切なあなた。\r\n今宵あなたを守る名誉を、\r\nこの私にいただけませんか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0dcc5e1072dd9533566bed7030b209e20c47c9bde8ef7c61b515614737adf3db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:620f3e6f3200265039da18aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あら、どこかからミモザの香りが…\r\n昔訪れた、プロヴァンスの春を\r\n思い出しますね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69048533537419d9f28f4becdf228ffa740e4284514b5236e5636e2c86f97ed3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28041ff65c37aa5f92f3efa1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "外はずいぶん暑そうですね…\r\n私の帽子でよければいつでもお貸し\r\nできますから、仰ってくださいね♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "829994e732c4327ff98f792c532d9106148f7540258617fc65af7d6f4ebbfd45",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed41a065b2fc906e2a0f2497",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "かぼちゃにイチジク、ジロール茸…\r\nフランス遠征の折には、\r\n秋の味覚も楽しみましょうねっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20ce474071443c3983adc83581f5737728cad6ec832945ad9bd5d4fab4e4b138",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ebb60307eded47cb0d32425",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ゴルシさんは\r\n今ごろ暖かいブラジルでしょうか…\r\nやっぱり同行すればよかったな…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6ebdb59891b96a5331ca68aeb1da8660fd26937d6d7e5de7d07739d8916eec3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99a7b9f1053da66bab604a13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8e4541e0e8636f1f3a8a83f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我弟弟非常可爱喔。\r\n每当我挑战新事物，他都会不认输地\r\n跟着一起挑战。呵呵♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "747c3a9eb6961bb81e73bd9137c22dc2eb06b2b18449d455586b2580ab3be2a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdbaead869bf41d4e349885e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "双亲总是定期寄东西给我，\r\n但房间已经放不下了……\r\n是否该租间仓库呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8afd21adf7e006e120ede06dee52e9a6f13ba45ae4ef992ede727bfbd784f26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:162176523a6f2ad48a4c4526",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说在布丁上淋酱油后吃起来\r\n就跟海胆一样！我可以试试看\r\n是不是真的吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "65b2eacf572ad1c8949019a6824ebcda0ba40e835125363c58b5272928587d6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:487fa8a4567dc3e30e51d16e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我正在学习下厨♪\r\n请问下次你愿意帮忙试吃吗？\r\n我一定会让你说出好吃的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4294528ae65fd4419ab19002c8788757f1835baf621d9364d9b569c51814ee6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:836a1608ea325fad03da9c8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我家亲戚很多，\r\n但其中却没几位赛马娘，\r\n这也让我对特雷森学园特别感兴趣。",
      "source_fingerprint": "97d822e6d464c7e9b9e53cbec2a1b09ab411783fce8909423701c5e25deac8e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52fa9485a5bcbc818ba9d355",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套服装穿起来好凉。\r\n得喝点热茶\r\n暖暖身子才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fd1eae3d551abfb208fb3e1bbc77981422bea83bf94b4cd3d9aa6a9f6ab4fbe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2226767d8124ae9c9e1bfaeb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正因大家都穿同款服装，为了能在\r\n舞台上更加突出，得好好磨练\r\n自己的表演才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ab73d6202a066c7651b4c0a7a0cfbf62e5e3de286d8721e850ffe4376d783e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0c60ab5a80857f6be6613db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很喜欢像荷叶边、缎带之类\r\n可爱的东西。轻飘飘～\r\n摇来摇去～我闹着玩的啦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "303b6bc280ff12e85f568b21e9ecef2393e0c6f8b2917c2bccf2775c4be92d86",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33bfed4b5532715d3816d03e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套决胜服背负了\r\n家族所有成员的心意……穿着这套\r\n衣服赢得荣耀正是我的使命。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29baa4ab3232c5120920341e7fa2fc6aab9298978fb774187faf8e63eaa6abc9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2536c6b3a9829b8a4352fcef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上的训练时间我会边听流行乐\r\n边进行。这样有助提神醒脑，\r\n又会觉得心情兴奋！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9af3a71d6a2f286edf04b66091c08131db63e29800022aefa6127b1902084ea3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f76ba48b6f845305546e50c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好啦！接下来是跟麦昆的午茶时光！\r\n希望她会喜欢今天的点心。\r\n呵呵♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d181593ce759207337215f226c87585dc7918a2ac4e1d43baf5866d052e998c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ef263c46f9131275ad3408a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "时间都这么晚了，\r\n你还在处理什么工作呢？\r\n请问方便让我看看吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a9e072234f388f76a65856c1de5aa9cef120d8e7e02d0bfee582c995473678d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:963677492d34e4d639daee6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天气真暖和，令人坐不住呢……！\r\n要不要一起外出呢？\r\n你觉得如何！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9b46ced5f0ea668750e200bea7efe0006438295ad9a75e5db3fe71c1c5cd7e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:351b8d95fe2d9099d7b9b3bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下雨天赛道会变得很难跑呢……\r\n我打算边做点晴天娃娃\r\n边思考对策。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7017b242e1f3d72a3845f96b2150e1456f74aca20e8bd2f2cbf6b34e5f28e42d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8e6322bf72ebf85fe50254c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年巴黎丰收节是不是也很热闹呢？\r\n我们全家曾经一起去，\r\n当时父亲玩得非常愉快呢……呵呵♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8cb0343e58e2a926b6eafa9206d8b0a1e6c5e3133c05696763e57b3203d89ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6efa92e60d15fbb7d659bf9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "花坛里的花花草草都长出了\r\n可爱的新芽。好期待看到\r\n美丽的花朵盛开呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbe30bddd27ad073611c0b0d7e837676354cf1437c2b3fd1b6cc2224dc8902b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39b6e30ca25a33fec3a8eaa2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "许多事情都会不断改变呢。无论是\r\n周围的环境，还是目标的终点……\r\n但最重要的心意……是不会改变的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d17a260a44ed768f91edd3280616eb8bc3c0d23bc2c6e636a3a235987f309bcc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e08e0032486c757f231391f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我也想看草上飞穿巫女服的样子。\r\n她就像是真正的大和抚子，\r\n穿巫女服一定会很好看……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c22472c9daae63b6a2478c6ff2d1ce72414dac48c859ee75a3a51e1234927c4e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ef1b785551c7752c4d321cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我知道特别周食量很大……\r\n但没想到她会误以为五层重箱的\r\n年菜是一人份……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "63a41afc96ca13e0341fa43595f5250528d9e1f710e8e7c879a0b9d82f90b06b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:790348349c44ed9e8e726333",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我穿这样出席和麦昆的茶会后，\r\n她称赞了这件衣服的颜色呢♪\r\n耶嘿嘿……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d7490f7f5885091924340a81e932cae0c31b64ceb2ef38177e53ddda8580344",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fbf7ac7c1a19876d781d27c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "巫女光钻的抽签占卜～♪\r\n训练员今天的运势～～\r\n是大吉呢！祝你有美好的一天～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3298d9dd9f05718bb917ca7d4e7d69077e418d00478a609b63e631773ac6de63",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9b90c4a4c45c9e06cbbee8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要一起去神社吗？\r\n在早上的神社洗涤心灵后，\r\n今天也要跟平常一样打破魔咒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbfa979af5a29dec28ef54dcc6ae89dd0673815949108ae681df8230903d26be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9af3db698a06ef1b105dd5b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "通常只要到了中午左右，\r\n我的衣服一定会乱掉……\r\n必须表现得像草上飞那样端庄才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c3dfa89ed12f8af687f8bb05560d47d036ec95ccce27eb7e294295cd27c9ba9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5f6a635facd97167ecd3a8c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，你又熬夜啦？话说……\r\n这件衣服的袖子很像棉被呢。\r\n所以……嘿，快点睡吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0afad403d1ebaa3b2bc6e32f816eb942ba5ae5df10fc0859bb2b5add2f3460a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69e0f4e3278b1abd1d1c856b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "崭新的春天，是开始的季节。\r\n新叶开始萌芽，花朵开始绽放……\r\n我也必须努力实现梦想！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a6b43b159033d309df3516cf5d8db9452f25d78e6d6a842a720de039844772e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65dc09a4ad2db830f6daf579",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天气热的时候果然就是要洒水呢！\r\n我跟小北说好，晚一点要一起\r\n到学园的各处去洒水♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3878e2ef8ce45fa153c644ff797afa3cdbea8221a774ba83f3a93349c1370cca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:551e2cbf5d56c02696a4cb6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到秋天，就会想到秋季祭典……\r\n我未来也想在骏大祭挑战流镝马。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eca2ea1d86a6f738923f5ee30d2d245bc58cd49c1024baebc1a5de0ad23f0573",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e78ea7b08ed22bb3a4539f94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然这个季节很冷，但内心会变得\r\n火热。冬天更要燃烧斗志变强！\r\n我现在就是这种心情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cbf1e1a315fa2b16c30b1d7350de9f43bf3e0c7f6a21b4e865d9e7e9d43ce3d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b986d4ab733b7f809fe8c297",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的腰间有一只乌龟。\r\n希望有一天能够跟它一起，\r\n沐浴在最棒的胜利光芒下♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e78b21496d324ce0882819428b246a790df24b49430513ff69a3556caa1e81e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44727f1ec3ec26168fc3abf9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多亏了这件衣服包含的历史……\r\n我现在觉得自己绝对不会输！\r\n无论是比赛，还是板羽球……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "88e2c196189d70c335638fe8fb1f1de7540c32678a87fe94851e4fc35ec7c2d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91029"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
